
# Functional AI Capability
 
This prototype demonstrates AI-assisted interpretation of Statistical Process Control (SPC) exceptions for GC2 laboratory standard runs.
 
The workflow operates as follows:
 
Power BI Detection → Power Automate → Historical Context Retrieval → AI Builder → Advisory Summary → AI Review Log
 
The AI does not perform anomaly detection. Detection remains rule-based and is performed by Power BI. AI is only invoked after a valid OOC or Trend event is identified.
 
